fix(mobile): fold finished projects into Quiet

The mobile Projects list showed every project flat, so a settled project
stayed in the list while the web sidebar had folded it away.

Settled and long-quiet projects now fold into a collapsed Quiet group
using the same projectSidebarBucket rule as web. The seven-day quiet
window moves into client-runtime as PROJECT_QUIET_AFTER_MS so both
clients share it.

